<title>UK: Paribas hires Pisker as co-head of bonds in London.</title>
<headline>Paribas hires Pisker as co-head of bonds in London.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paribas said in a statement on Wednesday it had hired Andrew Pisker, formerly of Lehman Brothers, to become co-head of bonds in its London-based operation.</p>
<p>Pisker, who was head of global debt syndicate and international credit trading at Lehman in London, will join Paribas' fixed income executive committee, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit + 44 171 542 6137</p>
</text>
